  "extractionNotes": "Grant evidenced by the ZUS titles screen: benefit title 1240 from 2026-08-31 to 2026-09-06 under the employment title (0110 from 2025-06-01), with a handwritten ZUS note that the right to maternity benefit was granted. The employer's Z-3 gives the same period and the date of the leave application to the employer (2026-08-11); the employer remarks that the employee sent the ZAO to ZUS himself on 2026-08-24 (used as asOf and applicationDate). One of two possible 7-day parts, within 12 months of the birth. Z-3 salary table 2025-08..2026-07: constant 20,750.00 contractual pay, 13.71% deduction; in 2026-05 only 9 of 20 days worked because of care benefit (zasilek opiekunczy, not modelled as a leave type). contributionBase inferred equal to column 6. Rate not printed (paternity is 100% by law). Payer size box not legible. Amounts not printed."
